<h1 data-copy-en="Chef Martha" data-copy-zh="Chef Martha">Chef Martha</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Restaurant events, dates and the Master Chef lesson." data-copy-zh="餐厅事件、约会与厨艺大师课程。">Restaurant events, dates and the Master Chef lesson.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Culinary_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beach_Day"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Starlight_Walk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Family_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Chef Martha — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chef-martha.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Chef Martha — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chef-martha.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Chef Martha — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Chef Martha offers a one-time Cooking increase, relationship conversations, dates and a Master Chef lesson. Her current personal menu starts at the Restaurant.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Downtown Restaurant: every day, 10:00–22:00. A date’s usable start must also fit this portrait schedule.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Reach Known (25) for Culinary Creativity, then progress through the personal Restaurant events at Known, Friend (100) and Close Friend (200). H2Hs and dates are separate buttons, with the start windows below.</p><p>Master Chef needs Romantic (800) and Cooking 60, plus the listed resources. It is a one-time lesson. Poppy offers another route to that same skill; learning it twice is unnecessary.</p><p>Private Evening opens at 1000 affection and 20:00–22:00, once daily. That threshold is below Intimate (1600).</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Special</th><td data-label="Requirements">Downtown Restaurant; Chef Martha Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chef Martha +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kitchen Confessions</th><td data-label="Requirements">Downtown Restaurant; Chef Martha Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chef Martha +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Competition</th><td data-label="Requirements">Downtown Restaurant; Chef Martha Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chef Martha +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Downtown Restaurant</th><td data-label="Requirements">Downtown Restaurant</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chef Martha +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tip Money</th><td data-label="Requirements">Downtown Restaurant; Chef Martha Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Actions_and_Skill_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Apartment_Visit:_Ordinary_Paths"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Apartment_Visit:_Special_Answers"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Chef Martha</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Culinary Creativity</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; Known (25); Communication 50</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Cooking +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Beach Day</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; Acquaintance (50); 14:00–17:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Starlight Walk</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; Close Friend (200); 19:00–22:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −10 Energy; +15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Farmers Market Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; Friend (100); 10:00–14:00; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; $50; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +5 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; Close Friend (200); Diane’s Boardwalk built; 17:00–20:00; full version; extra supporter-content access shown in the notice; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; $50; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +10 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Master Chef</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; Romantic (800); Cooking 60; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">300 min; $900; −150 Energy; −80 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Master Chef; once; +30 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Evening</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Downtown Restaurant; 1000 affection; 20:00–22:00; full version; temporarily unavailable during a visibly advanced pregnancy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+80 base affection; 1/day</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>The Farmers Market date is actually usable from 10:00–14:00 because she is not at the Restaurant at 09:00. The Boardwalk date additionally needs Diane’s construction and the access described in its notice.</p><p>Her optional pregnancy route adds Check In and later Family Check In: 30 minutes, once a day, +5 direct affection. Normal Talk remains available; the dates, personal H2Hs, Master Chef and Private Evening temporarily pause while the route’s showing-pregnancy restriction applies. See <a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">Pregnancy</a>.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: relationship bonuses</summary><p>Meeting each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before the remaining relationship bonuses. The favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct one-time affection rewards are added as listed.</p><p>Cooking 70; Creativity 50; Perception 40</p><p>Favorite skill: Silver Tongue</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Listed time and resources are base values; applicable skills, difficulty and active bonuses can change the shown cost or affection. Base affection, direct affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Visit the Restaurant; her menu does not offer a separate Apartment Visit button.</li><li>For Master Chef, check Cooking 60 and the current pregnancy availability notice as well as affection and costs.</li><li>The Boardwalk date begins from her Restaurant portrait, rather than requiring her to stand at the destination.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">Cooking skills</a></li><li><a href="character-poppy.html">Poppy</a></li><li><a href="character-diane.html">Diane and the Boardwalk</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Main Story navigation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Culinary_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Beach_Day"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starlight_Walk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Family_Continuation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Chef Martha 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chef-martha.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Chef Martha 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chef-martha.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Chef Martha 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Chef Martha 提供一次性烹饪提升、关系谈心、约会与厨艺大师课程。目前个人菜单从餐厅开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>市中心餐厅：每天 10:00–22:00。开始约会时，也必须处于她在场的时段。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>达到已知（25）后可学习料理创造力；餐厅个人事件随后在已知、朋友（100）与亲密朋友（200）阶段推进。谈心与约会是不同按钮，开始时段见下表。</p><p>厨艺大师要求浪漫感（800）、烹饪 60，以及表中资源，属于一次性课程。Poppy 也提供同一技能的另一条学习路线，无需重复学习。</p><p>私密之夜在 1000 好感度后开放，开始时段为 20:00–22:00，每天一次；此门槛低于亲密阶段（1600）。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">今日特餐</th><td data-label="条件">市中心餐厅; Chef Martha 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chef Martha +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">厨房私语</th><td data-label="条件">市中心餐厅; Chef Martha 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chef Martha +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">竞争对手</th><td data-label="条件">市中心餐厅; Chef Martha 亲密朋友 (200)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chef Martha +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">市中心的餐厅</th><td data-label="条件">市中心餐厅</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chef Martha +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">小费钱</th><td data-label="条件">市中心餐厅; Chef Martha 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Actions_and_Skill_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Apartment_Visit:_Ordinary_Paths"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Apartment_Visit:_Special_Answers"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Martha主厨 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">料理创造力</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 已知 (25); 沟通 50</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 烹饪 +1; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滩日</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 相识 (50); 14:00–17:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">星光漫步</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 亲密朋友 (200); 19:00–22:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −10 精力; +15 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">农贸市场约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 朋友 (100); 10:00–14:00; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; $50; −20 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +5 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨栈道日落约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 亲密朋友 (200); 已通过 Diane 建成木板路; 17:00–20:00; 完整版; 进入提示所列的额外支持者内容权限; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; $50; −30 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +10 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">厨艺大师</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 浪漫感 (800); 烹饪 60; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">300 分钟; $900; −150 精力; −80 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">厨艺大师；一次性; +30 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私密之夜</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">市中心餐厅; 1000 好感度; 20:00–22:00; 完整版; 孕期显怀时暂不可用</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −50 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+80 基础好感度; 1次/日</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>农贸市场约会实际可在 10:00–14:00 开始，因为她在 09:00 尚未到餐厅。木板路约会还要求完成 Diane 的建设，以及进入提示所列的内容权限。</p><p>她的可选孕期路线还会增加关心近况及后续的陪伴家人：30 分钟、每天一次，直接增加 5 好感度。常规交谈仍可进行；约会、个人谈心、厨艺大师与私密之夜会在孕期显怀限制生效期间暂时停用。详见<a href="game-systems-pregnancy.html">孕期系统</a>.</p><details><summary>可选查阅：关系加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。标为直接好感度的一次性奖励按表中数值加入。</p><p>烹饪 70; 创造力 50; 感知 40</p><p>偏好技能：巧舌如簧</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。表中耗时与资源为基础值；适用技能、难度及当前加成可能改变界面显示的消耗或好感度。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家情欲经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>请从餐厅访问；当前菜单没有单独的公寓探访按钮。</li><li>厨艺大师除好感度与消耗外，还需检查烹饪 60，以及当前孕期可用性提示。</li><li>木板路约会从她在餐厅的肖像开始，不要求她先站在约会目的地。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">烹饪技能</a></li><li><a href="character-poppy.html">Poppy</a></li><li><a href="character-diane.html">Diane 与木板路</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线导航</a></li></ul></section>
